		{"id":"e57eaa57f3bab051","type":"text","text":"observe_heading(ref, trust)\n· 首次：自动对齐 offset = ψ̂ − ref\n· 存 ref / trust，heading_age_ = 0","x":-1680,"y":1240,"width":480,"height":160},
		{"id":"62f845816025674e","type":"text","text":"⚠ 首次参考只做【对齐】不产生修正\n想让它转过去：从当前 yaw 斜坡过去","x":-2880,"y":1600,"width":480,"height":110},
